OL,3,GNEWSAHydro unlikely to host more
OL,4,Abare-knuckle boxing after mass brawl,
OL,5,ABBC understands
OL,6,
OL,7,FGlasgow's Ovo Hydro is unlikely to host
OL,8,Ffurther bare-knuckle boxing matches
OL,9,Fafter a mass brawl broke out after an
OL,10,Fevent at the weekend, the BBC
OL,11,Funderstands.
OL,13,FAbout 9,000 people were at the venue on
OL,14,FSaturday night for the first ever
OL,15,FScottish show by Bare Knuckle Fighting
OL,16,FChampionship.
OL,18,FThree police officers were hurt and two
OL,19,Fmen were arrested during the large
OL,20,Fdisturbance, which spilled onto the
OL,21,Fnearby Clyde Arc bridge.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
