OL,3,GNEWSAHydro unlikely to host more
OL,4,Abare-knuckle boxing after mass brawl,
OL,5,ABBC understands
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Hydro said the event had been
OL,8,Fcarried out safely inside the venue
OL,9,Fitself, and that it would consider
OL,10,Ffuture shows by the promotion on merit,
OL,11,Flike any other event.
